  "description": "Madonna R Öhlins Complete Bike\nEverything you need, nothing you don’t.\nThe Madonna R is ready for anything from home trails to bike park laps, running either 29-inch wheels or a mullet setup, with 165 mm of rear travel and a 170 mm fork.\nThe build on this Madonna reflects exactly where we set our own priorities. Fox or Öhlins suspension, tuned to perfectly match the kinematics, Sram brakes and drivetrain—either mechanical or wireless—and durable wheels from DT Swiss or Newmen. Finished off with OneUp cockpit and seatpost, Ergon touchpoints, and Maxxis tires. The configuration options allow for personal preference and fit, so you can grab the bike and go straight out of the box.\nTo learn more about the Madonna, you can find all details here and if you need help with your configuration, check out the extensive buyers’ guide or get in touch with us.",
